Modifications by Webruit (AGPL-3.0 section 5a), all under
packages/browseros-agent:

- 2026-10-29  Companions: named agent personas with their own starters,
  effort level, preferred apps and limits (shared schema, server store and
  API, system-prompt section, app picker and Companions page).
- 2026-10-29  Rebrand: user-visible product name changed to Webruit, new logo
  and extension icons, upstream promotional banners and starter prompts
  removed.
- 2026-10-29  Research to Google Sheets: read_pages browser tool (reads
  several URLs in background tabs), built-in companion skills with a
  research-to-sheet playbook attached to the Atlas companion.
- 2026-10-30  Take over / hand back: per-tab user control on the server
  (blocks agent tools on held tabs), request_handoff tool, overlay bar with
  Take over, Stop and Hand back, and an automatic follow-up on hand back.
- 2026-11-01  Permissions: risk tiers for every tool call, four modes with a
  mode x tier table, saved rules, approval cards (once / this chat / always),
  unattended runs deny instead of asking, companion site limits enforced,
  Settings > Permissions page.

Internal identifiers that refer to the BrowserOS platform API (for example
chrome.browserOS and BrowserOSAdapter) are unchanged.
